      "reason": "PBE0 is an explicitly documented one-parameter hybrid functional (25% HF exchange) and is an allowed choice for this neutral closed-shell HCN task; it is inexpensive for three atoms while including exact-exchange admixture relevant to shielding. This fixes the wavefunction as RKS for the singlet. The citation identifies the documented functional; it is not scientific validation.",
