      "reason": "def2-TZVP is an allowed polarized valence triple-zeta basis; for a three-atom molecule the cost is modest under the four-core / 192 MB-per-process limits, and the larger flexible basis is preferable to def2-SVP for the anisotropic GIAO tensor and its isotropic trace. The citation establishes the documented basis label, not scientific validation.",
